{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Transport Platform - Full API Flow",
    "description": "Alur testing end-to-end: Get Token (OAuth) -> Fleet Service (Bus/Route/GPS/Incident) -> Passenger Service (Register/Ticket) -> Stop Service (Halte/Boarding) -> ML Service (Predict/Anomaly). Base IP: 103.147.92.135.\n\nCATATAN PENTING SEBELUM MULAI:\n1. database/seed.sql SUDAH ADA dan SUDAH BERISI data oauth_clients — TIDAK perlu insert manual lagi (berbeda dari asumsi sebelumnya saat seed.sql belum ditemukan).\n2. Kredensial OAuth yang VALID dari seed.sql:\n   - client_id: node-red-iot / client_secret: nodered-iot-secret -> grant_types: client_credentials (PAKAI INI untuk folder '01 - OAuth')\n   - client_id: smart-transport-app / client_secret: smart-transport-secret -> grant_types: password,refresh_token SAJA (TIDAK bisa dipakai untuk client_credentials grant, akan selalu 'unauthorized_client' kalau dicoba)\n3. Passenger id 1-5 SUDAH ADA dari seed (Budi Santoso, Siti Rahayu, Ahmad Fauzi, Dewi Lestari, Rizky Pratama) — boleh skip 'Register Passenger' dan langsung pakai passenger_id 1-5 untuk testing GET/ticket.\n4. Pastikan schema + seed sudah di-import ke MySQL:\n   `cat database/sqema.sql | kubectl exec -i deploy/mysql -n smarttransport -- mysql -uroot -p<password> smarttransport`\n   `cat database/seed.sql | kubectl exec -i deploy/mysql -n smarttransport -- mysql -uroot -p<password> smarttransport`\n5. Known gap: /api/incidents TIDAK ada proxy di gateway -> akses langsung ke php-fleet (port 8001).\n6. Known gap: POST /api/passengers/count (php-stop) collision dengan rule /api/passengers (php-passenger) di gateway -> akses langsung ke php-stop (port 8020).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "smart-transport-full-flow-v1"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_ip", "value": "103.147.92.135" },
    { "key": "gateway_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:9000" },
    { "key": "oauth_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:3002" },
    { "key": "fleet_direct_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:8001" },
    { "key": "passenger_direct_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:8000" },
    { "key": "stop_direct_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:8020" },
    { "key": "ml_direct_url", "value": "http://{{base_ip}}:5000" },
    { "key": "client_id", "value": "node-red-iot" },
    { "key": "client_secret", "value": "nodered-iot-secret" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "bus_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "route_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "stop_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "passenger_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "card_number", "value": "CARD-001" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Health Checks (Semua Service)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Gateway Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/health",
            "description": "Cek status gabungan: oauth_server, php_passenger, php_stop, php_fleet semuanya harus 'UP'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET OAuth Server Health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{oauth_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Fleet Service Health (direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{fleet_direct_url}}/health",
            "description": "Cek database.connected dan rabbitmq.connected harus true."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Passenger Service Health (direct)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{passenger_direct_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Stop Service Health (direct)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{stop_direct_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET ML Service Health (direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{ml_direct_url}}/health",
            "description": "Cek model1, model2, model3 semuanya status 'LOADED'."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - OAuth (Wajib Sebelum Testing Lain)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Get Token (client_credentials)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved:', json.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Kredensial node-red-iot/nodered-iot-secret SUDAH ADA di seed.sql (grant_types: client_credentials) — tidak perlu insert manual. Test script otomatis simpan accessToken ke variable {{access_token}} untuk dipakai request lain.\n\nCatatan: getUserFromClient() di oauth model.js saat ini selalu return {id: 0} untuk client_credentials grant manapun (termasuk node-red-iot) — jadi X-User-Id yang di-inject gateway akan selalu '0'. Ini bisa menyebabkan 401 'Unauthorized' di endpoint yang mengecek passengerId === 0 (misal POST /api/tickets). Untuk testing endpoint yang butuh user_id asli (1-5), pertimbangkan dapatkan token lewat grant 'password' dengan akun passenger seed (email: budi@mail.com, dst — password hash sama untuk semua, cek dengan tim apa plaintext aslinya) memakai client smart-transport-app."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Introspect Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/introspect",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Expected: {\"active\":true,...}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Revoke Token (jalankan TERAKHIR, akan invalidate token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/revoke",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Fleet Service (lewat Gateway, port 9000)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Create Bus",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bus_id', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/buses",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate_number\": \"B1234XYZ\",\n  \"capacity\": 40,\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"driver_name\": \"Test Driver\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Route ini PUBLIK di gateway (tidak pakai authMiddleware) per versi terbaru proxyRoutes.js."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET List Buses",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/buses" }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Bus by ID",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/buses/{{bus_id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Update Bus",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/buses/{{bus_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"driver_name\": \"Updated Driver\",\n  \"status\": \"maintenance\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "PERLU FIX getJSON(true) di BusController::update() supaya body JSON terbaca. Tanpa fix ini akan selalu 'No updatable fields provided'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Bus Location",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/buses/{{bus_id}}/location" }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Create Route",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('route_id', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/routes",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rute Halte A - Halte B\",\n  \"origin\": \"Halte A\",\n  \"destination\": \"Halte B\",\n  \"total_stops\": 5,\n  \"distance_km\": 12.5,\n  \"est_duration_min\": 30\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET List Routes",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/routes" }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Buses by Route",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/routes/{{route_id}}/buses" }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Create GPS Log",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/gps",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"bus_id\": {{bus_id}},\n  \"route_id\": {{route_id}},\n  \"lat\": -6.2,\n  \"lng\": 106.8,\n  \"speed_kmh\": 35\n}"
            },
            "description": "PRASYARAT: bus_id dan route_id di atas harus sudah dibuat (jalankan 'Create Bus' dan 'Create Route' duluan). Event ini publish ke RabbitMQ 'gps.update', dikonsumsi python-ml."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET GPS History by Bus",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/gps/buses/{{bus_id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Create Incident (DIRECT - gateway belum proxy /api/incidents)",
